e pointing shoppers to quick-commerce apps. Official photo, eatbetterco.com","words":[[126.711,127.151],[127.231,127.791],[127.848,128.191],[128.235,128.591],[128.635,128.991],[129.044,129.151],[129.204,129.951],[130.015,130.591],[130.671,131.311],[131.391,132.111],[132.171,133.551]]},{"key":"gtm#11","text":"Bulk & Corporate Channels","words":[[134.095,134.991],[135.151,135.311],[135.359,135.791],[135.853,136.351]]},{"key":"gtm#12","text":"Custom made-to-order gift hampers for corporate clients, festive orders, and institutional events, enabling high-volume unit sales with predictable demand lead times .","words":[[136.717,137.471],[137.535,138.271],[138.335,138.591],[138.631,138.991],[139.031,139.151],[139.191,139.551],[139.611,140.351],[140.401,140.751],[140.808,141.471],[141.511,141.631],[141.688,142.431],[142.488,143.311],[143.373,143.871],[143.951,144.751],[144.815,145.071],[145.138,145.471],[145.535,145.791],[145.851,146.511],[146.58,146.991],[147.055,147.311],[147.378,147.711],[147.751,147.791]]},{"key":"gtm#13","text":"Corporate gifting banner. Official photo, eatbetterco.com","words":[[148.063,149.071],[149.151,149.551],[149.608,150.351],[150.395,150.751],[150.818,151.231],[151.391,153.071]]},{"key":"gtm#explain","text":"In simple words: Eat Better reaches people through four pillars: its own website, marketplaces, quick commerce, and corporate and bulk orders.","words":[[154.164,154.271],[154.328,154.671],[154.751,155.511],[155.601,155.871],[155.905,156.111],[156.161,156.511],[156.568,156.911],[156.951,157.231],[157.311,157.631],[157.691,158.191],[158.331,158.751],[158.791,158.911],[158.981,159.951],[160.008,161.071],[161.124,161.391],[161.462,162.351],[162.391,162.511],[162.559,162.991],[163.051,163.231],[163.279,163.471],[163.528,163.951]]},{"key":"matrix#0","text":"Same snack, four speeds","words":[[164.127,164.831],[164.898,165.551],[165.615,165.871],[165.951,166.431]]},{"key":"matrix#1","text":"Each channel has its own way of getting the pack to the customer, its own delivery speed, and its own reason to exist.","words":[[166.991,167.631],[167.681,168.031],[168.071,168.191],[168.231,168.351],[168.431,168.671],[168.731,168.911],[168.938,168.991],[169.031,169.311],[169.331,169.391],[169.455,169.711],[169.738,169.791],[169.811,169.871],[169.933,170.911],[170.971,171.151],[171.211,171.391],[171.444,171.871],[171.938,172.671],[172.691,172.751],[172.811,172.991],[173.071,173.311],[173.357,173.631],[173.684,173.791],[173.884,174.352]]},{"key":"matrix#2","text":"Margin optimization, data collection & brand building","words":[[174.682,175.711],[175.773,176.831],[176.895,177.151],[177.202,177.711],[177.871,178.031],[178.098,178.431],[178.475,178.831]]},{"key":"matrix#3","text":"National reach & marketplace search visibility","words":[[179.187,180.111],[180.178,180.511],[180.631,180.751],[180.811,181.471],[181.517,181.791],[181.849,182.431]]},{"key":"matrix#4","text":"High-volume unit sales & B2B social proof","words":[[182.815,183.871],[183.935,184.191],[184.271,184.671],[184.911,185.151],[185.311,185.951],[186.02,186.431],[186.538,187.071]]},{"key":"matrix#5","text":"Bars are on a log scale so minutes and days can share one line. Corporate orders are scheduled, not raced.","words":[[187.359,188.191],[188.211,188.271],[188.324,188.431],[188.471,188.511],[188.611,188.911],[188.978,189.311],[189.418,189.631],[189.681,190.031],[190.071,190.191],[190.271,190.591],[190.631,190.751],[190.804,191.071],[191.131,191.311],[191.391,192.311],[192.371,192.911],[192.957,193.231],[193.251,193.311],[193.367,194.191],[194.251,194.431],[194.498,194.911]]},{"key":"matrix#explain","text":"Think of it like this: Each route has its own speed. A website order can take a few days, while quick commerce can deliver in minutes from a nearby dark store.","words":[[195.67,195.803],[195.83,195.883],[195.936,196.043],[196.091,196.283],[196.347,197.083],[197.131,197.323],[197.39,197.723],[197.763,197.883],[197.923,198.043],[198.103,198.283],[198.363,199